ອາຣີໂຊນາ. EXT. ເຂດດິນເຜົ່າຂອງວິນລຽມ: ວິນລາມເວົ້າກັບກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບ.

645
00:46:12,550 --> 00:46:18,550
[WILLIAM]
I will marry Laurie, a singer- songwriter. We'll get divorced in a year. Then I'll meet Sandy, we will marry, and I will continue to do my pottery.
