ຫົວເກົ່າລົງທາງແລ່ນ, ຍົກເຂົ້າໄປໃນອາກາດ - ດໍໂຣເທຍເບິ່ງຄືວ່າມີຄວາມສຸກແລະຟຣີ.

648
00:46:32,050 --> 00:46:38,050
[JAMIE]
I'll try to explain to him what his grandmother was like - but it will be impossible. CLOSE ON DOROTHEA'S FACE AS THE PLANE FLIES ABOVE THE SANTA BARBARA COAST, THE EXCITEMENT OF FLIGHT IN HER EXPRESSION. AS TIME GOES BY PLAYS.
